# EXPECT: Enter number of atmosphere phase screen element: \[\d+\]: 3[\s\S]*?ATMCHK tilt  ok[^\n]*C/EFL x 0\.96\d+ y 0\.96\d+[\s\S]*?ATMCHK PASS
# EXPECT: ATMOS: element 3 refused for the RAY grid: the screen tilts rays in the source grid\s+frame \(xGrid, yGrid\)[\s\S]*?grid x\.xGrid, y\.yGrid =\s+-?0\.000000\s+1\.000000; beam\.xGrid, beam\.yGrid =\s+-1\.000000\s+0\.000000[\s\S]*?or answer ATM
# EXPECT: (ATMCHK tilt  ok[^\n]*C/EFL x 0\.98\d+ y 0\.98\d+[\s\S]*?ATMCHK PASS[\s\S]*?){2}
